[en.FOCUS_C12_RESTORE_THE_RELATIONSHIP]
Restoration of Friendship

[en.FOCUS_C12_RESTORE_THE_RELATIONSHIP_desc]
Appleloosa is already within our grasp. We will leverage our advanced industrial capabilities to assist our remote relatives in rapidly developing and further unification. From now on, the two families will be inseparable.

[zh.FOCUS_C12_RESTORE_THE_RELATIONSHIP]
重拾友谊

[zh.FOCUS_C12_RESTORE_THE_RELATIONSHIP_desc]
苹果鲁萨已经成为我们的囊中之物，我们将利用先进的工业水平帮助我们的亲戚快速发展并进一步团结。从此，两个家族将不再分离。

